name: Sixth Sense — single 6 spectral
author: corpus
description: >-
  If the first hand of a round is a single 6, Sixth Sense destroys the 6 and creates a
  Spectral card. First-shop spectral engine: Oops All 6s makes the 6 guaranteed if you
  can draw it, and then you can chain Spectral effects.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SixthSense
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
  - joker: GiftCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 20
